        "titolo_orig": "As WHO sounds alarm over Ebola in DRC, what can be learned from previous outbreaks?",
        "testo_it": "L'OMS lancia l'allarme Ebola in Congo: i conflitti locali rischiano di ostacolare i soccorsi.",
        "priorita": "Media",
        "id_gruppo": 4,
        "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/19/why-the-lessons-of-the-drcs-last-ebola-outbreak-are-being-tested-again",
